<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>NUMBER - Redefine Your Style</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        header {
            background: black;
            color: gold;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            background: #333;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            padding: 14px 20px;
            text-decoration: none;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            background: gold;
            color: black;
        }

        .hero {
            background: url('hero-image.jpg') center/cover no-repeat;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 100px 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 50px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 20px;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background: gold;
            color: black;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .products {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .product {
            margin: 15px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            border-radius: 5px;
            width: 250px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .product img {
            max-width: 100%;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
        }

        .product h3 {
            padding: 10px 0;
        }

        footer {
            background: black;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>NUMBER</h1>
        <p>Redefine Your Style</p>
    </header>
    
    <nav>
        <a href="#shop">Shop</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="hero">
        <h1>Unleash Your Style</h1>
        <p>Discover premium T-shirts designed to stand out.</p>
        <a href="#shop" class="btn">Shop Now</a>
    </div>

    <section id="shop" class="products">
        <div class="product">
            <img src="tshirt1.jpg" alt="T-shirt 1">
            <h3>Classic Black Tee</h3>
            <p>$25.00</p>
        </div>
        <div class="product">
            <img src="tshirt2.jpg" alt="T-shirt 2">
            <h3>Golden NUMBER Tee</h3>
            <p>$30.00</p>
        </div>
        <div class="product">
            <img src="tshirt3.jpg" alt="T-shirt 3">
            <h3>Minimal White Tee</h3>
            <p>$20.00</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about">
        <div style="text-align: center; padding: 20px;">
            <h2>About Us</h2>
            <p>NUMBER is more than just a brand. It’s a movement for those who love minimalism and bold style. Founded with the vision of delivering premium quality T-shirts, NUMBER blends simplicity with edge to give you a wardrobe staple you'll love to wear.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
        <div style="text-align: center; padding: 20px;">
            <h2>Contact Us</h2>
            <p>Email: contact@numberbrand.com</p>
            <p>Phone: +1 234 567 890</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2025 NUMBER. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
